== Walkthrough ==

''[[Nexvok Thirod]] is located at -51, -248 in the Sewers of East Freeport among the Dismal Rage.''

You say, 'Hail, Nexvok Thirod'

: Nexvok Thirod says, 'I am Nexvok, master wizard of the Dismal Rage.  My associates Heneva and Konious and I provide our services to master Zarn on a regular basis.  People of our talent are in high demand. and Pietro pays well, so we are, of course, very loyal.'

'''Hand [[Nexvok Thirod]] [[a tattered note]].'''

:: ''A tattered note reads:''

:: <code>The Dismal Rage has need of your dark skills. Take this note to Nexvok Thirod, he has a job for you. The Dismal Rage is currently operating out of the basement of an abandoned building in the slums of East Freeport.</code>

: Nexvok Thirod says, 'Thanks'

